 "description": "<p>Aappilattoq (IATA: AOQ) is a settlement in the Qaasuitsup municipality in northwestern Greenland, located on an island of the same name in the southern part of Upernavik Archipelago. Founded in 1805,&nbsp;the settlement had 180 inhabitants in 2010. Source:&nbsp;http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Aappilattoq,_Qaasuitsup</p><p>For further information (in Danish) see also the Danish Geodata Agency: <a href=\"http://www.gronlandskehavnelods.dk/#HID=63\" target=\"_blank\">Den grønlandske Havnelods</a>.</p>",
